0 FILE 10183 - 9 - 3 axis steam locomotive.ldr
0 LEGO 3-axle steam locomotive (set 10183-1, alternate "9"): a black loco with three single-axle wheel bogies, magnetic couplings and buffer beams at both ends, a rounded boiler with grille vents and dome cylinders, a glazed cab with door rails and ladders, red and yellow headlamps, a smokebox-front minifig-head detail and an attached rear service platform
0 Name: 10183 - 9 - 3 axis steam locomotive.ldr
0 Author: Bert Van Raemdonck [BEAVeR]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under CCAL version 2.0 : see CAreadme.txt
